(3. The 'original' Report should be retained in a safe place and be made available to any person inspecting or undertaking work on the electrical installation in the) Tj
T* (future. If the property is vacated, this Report will provide the new owner/occupier with details of the condition of the electrical installation at the time the Report was) Tj
T* (issued.) Tj
